<title>CHINA: China Jan-June oil products trade.</title>
<headline>China Jan-June oil products trade.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports and imports of oil products for January to June, as reported by official customs figures:</p>
<p>		  JUNE IMPORTS    JAN-JUNE IMPORTS    VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Naphtha	 160,058	   269,752	  -  8.0 PERCENT</p>
<p> Gasoline	 15,983	    43,481	  -  1.0</p>
<p> Jet fuel		0.489	     0.504    - 99.0</p>
<p> Kerosene	185,641	   684,385	  +523.0</p>
<p>Light diesel</p>
<p>  fuel	   875,461	 4,239,715	  + 93.0</p>
<p>Heavy diesel</p>
<p>  fuel	     9,011	    47,249	  +189.0</p>
<p> Propane	  67,427	   187,542	  - 66.0</p>
<p>Liquefied</p>
<p> natural gas     7,147	    92,738	  +990.0</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
<p>		  JUNE EXPORTS    JAN-JUNE EXPORTS    VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Naphtha	   4,463	    22,857	  +407.0 PERCENT</p>
<p> Gasoline	255,179	   973,027	  + 94.0</p>
<p> Jet fuel		-	     2,000		 -</p>
<p> Kerosene	 65,372	   338,448	  + 39.0</p>
<p>Light diesel</p>
<p>  fuel	   596,529	 1,200,900	  + 70.0</p>
<p>Heavy diesel</p>
<p>  fuel		   -		   -	  -100.0</p>
<p> Propane		 -	    12,720	  - 70.0</p>
<p>Liquefied</p>
<p> natural gas	   -	     1,470	  - 90.0</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
</text>
